      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹113 (vs ₹99.30 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹113 (up from ₹99.30 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹21.9b (up 11% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.92b (up 14% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 8.8% (up from 8.6% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 19% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 18% per year.",
